{"seq":2,"slug":"vertex-geometry-processing","title":"顶点与几何处理阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/pipeline-architecture/vertex-geometry-processing","wordCount":1919,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"顶点与几何处理阶段\">顶点与几何处理阶段</h1><p>顶点与几何处理阶段负责将应用程序提交的原始顶点数据变换到裁剪空间，并可选地生成新的几何体。这是管线中最具弹性的阶段——从最简的顶点变换到复杂的程序化几何生成，都在这一区间内完成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>坐标空间变换链</strong>：顶点经历 Model → World → View → Clip → NDC → Screen 的逐级变换，每次变换服务于不同的计算需求</li>\n<li><strong>Post-Transform Cache</strong>：GPU 缓存最近处理过的顶点结果，通过索引缓冲的顺序优化实现顶点着色器调用次数的显著减少</li>\n<li><strong>可选阶段的代价与收益</strong>：曲面细分和几何着色器提供额外的几何生成能力，但各自存在性能陷阱，现代管线中正被 Mesh Shader 逐步取代</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"input-assembly-与顶点获取\">Input Assembly 与顶点获取</h2><p>Input Assembly（IA）阶段是管线的起点，它从顶点缓冲（Vertex Buffer）和索引缓冲（Index Buffer）中读取原始顶点数据，将其组装为图元（点、线、三角形）供后续阶段处理。</p>\n<p>顶点缓冲的布局通过 Vertex Input Description 定义，指定每个顶点属性（位置、法线、UV、切线等）的偏移量、步幅和格式。两种常见的布局策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>交错布局（Interleaved）</strong>：所有属性交错存放在单个缓冲中（PNPNPN...）。对缓存友好，适合所有属性都被采样的场景</li>\n<li><strong>分离布局（Separate）</strong>：每种属性存放在独立的缓冲中。允许部分 Pass 只绑定需要的属性（如 Shadow Pass 只需位置），减少带宽浪费</li>\n</ul>\n<p>索引缓冲通过共享顶点减少数据冗余。现代 GPU 在索引读取后进行 Post-Transform Cache 查询——如果同一索引的顶点最近已被处理过，直接复用结果而不重新执行 Vertex Shader。典型的 Post-Transform Cache 大小为 16-32 个顶点，这意味着合理的索引顺序可以显著减少顶点着色器调用次数。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[Vertex Buffer] --&gt; C[Input Assembly]&#10;    B[Index Buffer] --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; D{Post-Transform Cache Hit?}&#10;    D --&gt;|Yes| E[复用缓存结果]&#10;    D --&gt;|No| F[Vertex Shader]&#10;    F --&gt; G[写入 Cache]&#10;    G --&gt; H[输出到下一阶段]&#10;    E --&gt; H\">graph TD\n    A[Vertex Buffer] --&gt; C[Input Assembly]\n    B[Index Buffer] --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; D{Post-Transform Cache Hit?}\n    D --&gt;|Yes| E[复用缓存结果]\n    D --&gt;|No| F[Vertex Shader]\n    F --&gt; G[写入 Cache]\n    G --&gt; H[输出到下一阶段]\n    E --&gt; H</pre><h2 id=\"vertex-shader-的变换流水线\">Vertex Shader 的变换流水线</h2><p>Vertex Shader 是第一个可编程阶段，对每个顶点独立执行。它的核心任务是坐标空间变换：将模型空间坐标经过 Model、View、Projection 三个矩阵变换到裁剪空间（Clip Space）。</p>\n<p>变换链的数学表达：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>j</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{clip} = M_{projection} \\times M_{view} \\times M_{model} \\times P_{local}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ec</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">oc</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>除坐标变换外，Vertex Shader 还承担以下任务：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>任务</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>典型用例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>骨骼动画（Skinning）</td>\n<td>根据骨骼权重混合多个关节矩阵</td>\n<td>角色动画</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>顶点位移</td>\n<td>基于纹理或程序化函数偏移顶点位置</td>\n<td>海浪、地形</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逐顶点光照</td>\n<td>在顶点级计算光照（低精度但快）</td>\n<td>移动端优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>属性传递</td>\n<td>计算并输出切线空间、世界法线等</td>\n<td>法线贴图准备</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实例化数据读取</td>\n<td>从实例缓冲获取每实例变换/参数</td>\n<td>GPU Instancing</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Vertex Shader 的输出通过 Varying（GLSL）/ 插值器（HLSL <code>out</code>）传递给后续阶段。硬件对这些输出进行透视正确的重心坐标插值后送入片段着色器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"曲面细分阶段\">曲面细分阶段</h2><p>曲面细分（Tessellation）将低多边形网格动态细分为高密度几何体，实现基于视距的自适应细节。该阶段由三个子阶段组成：</p>\n<p><strong>Hull Shader（DX）/ Tessellation Control Shader（GL）</strong>：接收一个图元的所有控制点，输出细分因子（TessLevel）和修改后的控制点。细分因子决定了 Tessellator 在每条边上生成多少新顶点。</p>\n<p><strong>Tessellator</strong>：固定功能硬件，根据 Hull Shader 指定的因子在参数域（u,v 或重心坐标）内生成新顶点坐标。支持三种域类型：三角形、四边形、等值线（isoline）。</p>\n<p><strong>Domain Shader（DX）/ Tessellation Evaluation Shader（GL）</strong>：对 Tessellator 生成的每个新顶点执行，利用原始控制点和参数域坐标计算最终位置。典型应用是采样位移贴图来偏移顶点高度。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[Patch 控制点] --&gt; B[Hull Shader]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Tessellator]&#10;    B --&gt; D[输出控制点]&#10;    C --&gt; E[参数域坐标]&#10;    D --&gt; F[Domain Shader]&#10;    E --&gt; F&#10;    F --&gt; G[细分后顶点]\">graph LR\n    A[Patch 控制点] --&gt; B[Hull Shader]\n    B --&gt; C[Tessellator]\n    B --&gt; D[输出控制点]\n    C --&gt; E[参数域坐标]\n    D --&gt; F[Domain Shader]\n    E --&gt; F\n    F --&gt; G[细分后顶点]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>参数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>典型范围</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>外部细分因子</td>\n<td>控制图元边的分段数</td>\n<td>1-64</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内部细分因子</td>\n<td>控制图元内部的细分密度</td>\n<td>1-64</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分区模式</td>\n<td>等距/分数奇/分数偶</td>\n<td>影响过渡平滑度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>输出拓扑</td>\n<td>三角形/线段</td>\n<td>取决于域类型</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>自适应细分的常见策略是根据图元到摄像机的距离和屏幕空间大小动态调整细分因子。距离远的图元使用低因子（甚至为 1 跳过细分），距离近的图元使用高因子获取细节。这确保了像素级别的三角形密度不浪费在远处几何上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"geometry-shader-与-stream-output\">Geometry Shader 与 Stream Output</h2><p>Geometry Shader（GS）接收一个完整图元（含邻接信息可选），可以输出零到多个新图元。它是唯一能在管线中间增删图元的可编程阶段。</p>\n<p>典型用例：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>粒子系统展开</strong>：输入点图元，输出面向摄像机的四边形（Billboard）</li>\n<li><strong>阴影体生成</strong>：根据光源方向拉伸轮廓边为阴影几何</li>\n<li><strong>法线/切线可视化</strong>：在顶点位置生成线段用于调试</li>\n<li><strong>多视口渲染</strong>：通过 <code>SV_ViewportArrayIndex</code> 一次绘制到多个渲染目标</li>\n</ul>\n<p>然而 Geometry Shader 存在严重的性能问题。它打破了管线的并行性假设——输出图元数量不确定使得硬件无法有效预分配缓冲。每个 GS 调用的输出必须串行写入，创建了执行瓶颈。在现代管线中，GS 的大多数用例已被更高效的方案替代：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传统 GS 用例</th>\n<th>现代替代方案</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Billboard 展开</td>\n<td>Compute Shader + Instancing</td>\n<td>并行度更高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>阴影体</td>\n<td>Shadow Map</td>\n<td>算法更通用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图元裁剪</td>\n<td>Mesh Shader 中的 Task Shader</td>\n<td>硬件原生支持</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多视口</td>\n<td>ViewportIndex 在 VS 直接设置</td>\n<td>省去 GS 阶段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Stream Output（SO）/ Transform Feedback 允许将管线中间结果写回缓冲，用于多 Pass 处理（如物理模拟结果反馈）。但同样因性能问题，在现代引擎中已被 Compute Shader 的 UAV 写入完全取代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"裁剪与屏幕映射\">裁剪与屏幕映射</h2><p>Vertex Shader（或最终的几何阶段）输出裁剪空间坐标后，硬件执行以下固定功能操作：</p>\n<p><strong>视锥裁剪（Frustum Clipping）</strong>：基于齐次坐标的六个裁剪面（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-w \\leq x \\leq w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>w</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-w \\leq y \\leq w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 \\leq z \\leq w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 对于 DX）对图元进行裁剪。完全在视锥外的图元直接丢弃；部分跨越裁剪面的图元被切割为新的多边形。</p>\n<p><strong>透视除法（Perspective Division）</strong>：将裁剪坐标除以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">w</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span> 分量得到归一化设备坐标（NDC）。NDC 空间范围为 [-1,1] x [-1,1] x [0,1]（DX）或 [-1,1]^3（GL）。</p>\n<p><strong>视口变换（Viewport Transform）</strong>：将 NDC 映射到最终的窗口坐标。通过 Viewport 和 Scissor Rect 设置确定输出区域。</p>\n<p>这三步完全由硬件固定功能完成，开发者通过管线状态配置（Viewport、DepthRange）控制行为。裁剪后的图元携带正确的窗口坐标进入光栅化阶段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>顶点与几何处理阶段将原始顶点数据经由坐标变换、可选的曲面细分和几何着色，最终输出裁剪空间图元。Post-Transform Cache 和索引优化是提升此阶段吞吐量的关键手段。Geometry Shader 因并行性问题在现代管线中逐渐被 Mesh Shader 取代，曲面细分则在需要动态几何细节的场景中保持其价值。</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>相关文档：<a href=\"gpu-pipeline-overview\">GPU 管线全景概览</a> 提供管线各阶段的宏观定位；<a href=\"rasterization-fragment\">光栅化与片段处理</a> 承接本文输出，详解三角形如何变为像素。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"顶点与几何处理阶段","id":"顶点与几何处理阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"Input Assembly 与顶点获取","id":"input-assembly-与顶点获取"},{"level":2,"text":"Vertex Shader 的变换流水线","id":"vertex-shader-的变换流水线"},{"level":2,"text":"曲面细分阶段","id":"曲面细分阶段"},{"level":2,"text":"Geometry Shader 与 Stream Output","id":"geometry-shader-与-stream-output"},{"level":2,"text":"裁剪与屏幕映射","id":"裁剪与屏幕映射"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"GPU 图形管线全景概览","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/pipeline-architecture/gpu-pipeline-overview"},"next":{"title":"光栅化与片段处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/realtime-rendering-pipeline/pipeline-architecture/rasterization-fragment"}}